{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25557","headline":"六叹 一 · 李涉","name":"六叹 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绮罗香风翡翠车，清明独傍芙蓉渠。\n上有云鬟洞仙女，垂罗掩縠烟中语。\n风月频惊桃李时，沧波久别鸳鸿侣。\n欲传一札孤飞翼，山长水远无消息。\n却锁重门一院深，半夜空庭明月色。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}